    "Zhu Shunquan is the CEO of Hubei Dinglong, a maker of semiconductor materials such as used in display and chemical mechanical polishing.",
    "He cofounded Dinglong in 2000 in Wuhan, Hubei province with his brother, Shuangquan, who serves as its chairman.",
    "The company went public on the Shenzhen Growth Enterprise Market for high-tech startups in 2010.",
    "Prior to Dinglong, Shunquan worked at a state-owned company in international trade and investment."
